Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Leave empty bio transitions out of the bio history

Checking a real database showed 81 of 176 feed_bio rows record a transition
to an empty bio, 30 distinct friends inside the same 13 seconds. The API
intermittently returns friends with an empty bio during a list refresh, so
those rows are read artifacts rather than players clearing their profile.

The history query now skips them so the profile dialog does not present that
noise as edits, and the change recorder keeps requiring both sides to be non
empty.
